skills-lock.json

# --- Playwright (FUEL-69) ---
#
# The BASELINES under tests/visual/__screenshots__/ ARE committed — they are the
# reference the suite compares against, and TESTING_STRATEGY § 2.3 asks for
# exactly that. What is ignored is everything a RUN produces.
#
# test-results/ holds the actual-vs-expected pairs and traces from a failure.
# They are large, they are regenerated by the next run, and they are pictures of
# a demo account.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
# The provisioned demo session. A live session cookie for a real (if temporary)
# account, written fresh by the setup project on every run.
tests/visual/.auth/
